<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Referral Credit Earned</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
      .content { background: white; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
      .amount { font-size: 2em; font-weight: bold; color: #10b981; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
      .button { display: inline-block; background: #3b82f6; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; }
      .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>🎉 Congratulations!</h1>
        <p>You've earned a referral credit!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <%= @referrer.name || @referrer.email.split('@').first %>,</p>

        <p>Great news! Someone you referred has just subscribed, and you've earned a referral credit:</p>

        <div class="amount">$<%= sprintf('%.2f', @credit_amount) %></div>

        <p><strong>Referral Details:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Referred User:</strong> <%= @referee.name || @referee.email %></li>
          <li><strong>Credit Amount:</strong> $<%= sprintf('%.2f', @credit_amount) %></li>
          <li><strong>Status:</strong> Available for use</li>
          <li><strong>Date Earned:</strong> <%= @reward.earned_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></li>
        </ul>

        <p>Your credit will be automatically applied to your next subscription bill. You can view all your referral credits and share your referral link in your account settings.</p>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
          <a href="<%= ENV['APP_URL'] || 'http://localhost:3000' %>/settings" class="button">
            View My Referral Dashboard
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>Keep sharing your referral link to earn more credits!</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>The Team</p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>This credit will be automatically applied to your next subscription renewal.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>